            "analysis": "保证右侧区间最大值小于左侧区间最大值。",
            "points": 3,
            "hasAnswer": true
          },
          {
            "id": "p2_3",
            "type": "single",
            "question": "填空(3): ③处应填（ ）。",
            "options": [
              {
                "value": "A",
                "label": "(long long)(j - mid) * max"
              },
              {
